# In a short pane with word wrap on, moving onto a task that wraps to five lines shows all five lines.
# BUG: the 2-row scroll margin wins over the focused block's own lines, so its last line stays below the pane (ui.md §2 Wrap).
size 25 8
file <<END
Packing:
	- Remember to pack the universal power adapter and the spare charging cables for everyone
Done
END
keys gw j
see - Remember to pack
see cables for everyone
quit
